(3883963, 551201, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, this struck me!  I think you had a different meaning behind it judging by your title, but....this is a POWERFUL piece!  Perhaps, I''m looking more deeply than I should be, but I see this as a very powerful "good touch, bad touch" type of statement and it really hits the mark in that aspect.  LOVE IT!!!  I guess we all see things differently and that''s the beauty of art/photography, isn''t it?  9 from me!</td>', 'Wow, this struck me!  I think you had a different meaning behind it judging by your title, but....this is a POWERFUL piece!  Perhaps, I''m looking more deeply than I should be, but I see this as a very powerful "good touch, bad touch" type of statement and it really hits the mark in that aspect.  LOVE IT!!!  I guess we all see things differently and that''s the beauty of art/photography, isn''t it?  9 from me!', '2007-07-09 01:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
