(3884051, 550314, 66515, '<td valign="top">A lot of people probably had this dichotomy in mind. Few likely figured out how to portray it. I like the way you''ve presented it. Even if you take the title away the image stands well enough on its own as the title you''ve selected would be a likely one.</td>', 'A lot of people probably had this dichotomy in mind. Few likely figured out how to portray it. I like the way you''ve presented it. Even if you take the title away the image stands well enough on its own as the title you''ve selected would be a likely one.', '2007-07-09 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
