(3884061, 550860, 66515, '<td valign="top">Two distinct items yet not really in opposition. They need to be part of the same class of things to be considered a dichotomy. Two parts of a greater whole so to speak. <br/> <br/>Aside from that? Too much chalk. Not enough cheese...</td>', 'Two distinct items yet not really in opposition. They need to be part of the same class of things to be considered a dichotomy. Two parts of a greater whole so to speak.  Aside from that? Too much chalk. Not enough cheese...', '2007-07-09 01:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
