(3884117, 547033, 66515, '<td valign="top">Either the ball or the dog need to be in good focus for this to work well. You have your focus kinda in the middle which isn''t really one of the elements you need to focus on. <br/> <br/>Aside from that? The DPC crowd doesn''t vote well on pet shots. (I disagree with this since pets can portray such a broad range of emotions and it is something special to capture that). In terms of the challenge I like the approach. Its unique and well thought out. I guarantee there is going to be a lot of shoe horn entries in this challenge: this isn''t one of them.</td>', 'Either the ball or the dog need to be in good focus for this to work well. You have your focus kinda in the middle which isn''t really one of the elements you need to focus on.  Aside from that? The DPC crowd doesn''t vote well on pet shots. (I disagree with this since pets can portray such a broad range of emotions and it is something special to capture that). In terms of the challenge I like the approach. Its unique and well thought out. I guarantee there is going to be a lot of shoe horn entries in this challenge: this isn''t one of them.', '2007-07-09 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
