(3885650, 550068, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the post editing.  Might not suit everybody''s taste, but I like how it is almost like a charcoal drawing painted with pastels or color paint.  Fantastic composition.  One of the best so far in my opinion.</td>', 'Love the post editing.  Might not suit everybody''s taste, but I like how it is almost like a charcoal drawing painted with pastels or color paint.  Fantastic composition.  One of the best so far in my opinion.', '2007-07-09 12:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885652, 550519, 15711, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I love the tones of this.  If it were in colour, the shapes wouldn''t be nearly as magnified as they are in BW.  7</td>', 'Well done.  I love the tones of this.  If it were in colour, the shapes wouldn''t be nearly as magnified as they are in BW.  7', '2007-07-09 12:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885655, 549644, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great narrow DOF!!!!  I like the way his one antennae blurs into the background. Terrific focus.  With this idea being so esoteric, I was hoping for maybe a more thoughtful approach, but this image is great for a nature shot.</td>', 'Great narrow DOF!!!!  I like the way his one antennae blurs into the background. Terrific focus.  With this idea being so esoteric, I was hoping for maybe a more thoughtful approach, but this image is great for a nature shot.', '2007-07-09 12:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885658, 548063, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  I did that once and yours puts my version to shame. I wish she were face straight on. No big deal, but it would have had even more impace.  She seems slightly turned to the left. Isn''t makeup grand? ;~D</td>', 'Pretty cool.  I did that once and yours puts my version to shame. I wish she were face straight on. No big deal, but it would have had even more impace.  She seems slightly turned to the left. Isn''t makeup grand? ;~D', '2007-07-09 12:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
