(3885665, 548671, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene. I love the touch of green, which you don''t normall see in a seascape.  Great tonal range and contrast.  The perspective is as if you are a sandpiper running across the sand.</td>', 'What a beautiful scene. I love the touch of green, which you don''t normall see in a seascape.  Great tonal range and contrast.  The perspective is as if you are a sandpiper running across the sand.', '2007-07-09 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
