(3886636, 551179, 66353, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative :)</td>', 'Very imaginative :)', '2007-07-09 18:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3886641, 551408, 66398, '<td valign="top">Had to look up what those were and still don''t know. All I could figure was that they both had to do with blood. I''ll take your word for it that they''re mutually exclusive groups. And blood being one of the things we can''t do without I get the burst of life fade of death reference but also how the two fireworks here reflect that as well. One has just burst and the other is nearly dead. Looks like you are an intelligent person who''s put a lot of thought into this challenge. As for the technicals I think you''ve done a good job here as well. The composition and color are pleasing. I know July 4th shots I took came out squiggly on most of them because I didn''t use a tripod. In the end this probably isn''t going to get the score it deserves.</td>', 'Had to look up what those were and still don''t know. All I could figure was that they both had to do with blood. I''ll take your word for it that they''re mutually exclusive groups. And blood being one of the things we can''t do without I get the burst of life fade of death reference but also how the two fireworks here reflect that as well. One has just burst and the other is nearly dead. Looks like you are an intelligent person who''s put a lot of thought into this challenge. As for the technicals I think you''ve done a good job here as well. The composition and color are pleasing. I know July 4th shots I took came out squiggly on most of them because I didn''t use a tripod. In the end this probably isn''t going to get the score it deserves.', '2007-07-09 18:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3886643, 550383, 80728, '<td valign="top">Ironic. Good capture.</td>', 'Ironic. Good capture.', '2007-07-09 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
