(3890141, 551349, 80278, '<td valign="top">This is an alliterating oxymoron, not a dichotomy, hence the low score.<br/>But a neat image nonetheless!<br/>Some of the whites are burned out. You can paint the detail back, with a variety of techniques.</td>', 'This is an alliterating oxymoron, not a dichotomy, hence the low score.But a neat image nonetheless!Some of the whites are burned out. You can paint the detail back, with a variety of techniques.', '2007-07-10 18:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
