(3890390, 551179, 45475, '<td valign="top">Outstanding use of props. Great lighting and perspective. Very clever idea, I gave this a 10. Congrats in advance, I''m certain this will ribbon.</td>', 'Outstanding use of props. Great lighting and perspective. Very clever idea, I gave this a 10. Congrats in advance, I''m certain this will ribbon.', '2007-07-10 19:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890398, 548671, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fantastic dreamscape. Love everything about this. I gave this a 10 and now faved.</td>', 'Fantastic dreamscape. Love everything about this. I gave this a 10 and now faved.', '2007-07-10 19:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890401, 550314, 45475, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. Love what has happened to the flare here. Brilliant.</td>', 'Excellent idea. Love what has happened to the flare here. Brilliant.', '2007-07-10 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890402, 551180, 36382, '<td valign="top">That chicken looks like something out of a Steven Spielberg movie.  The lighting is good and the shadow is falling beautifully onto the book.</td>', 'That chicken looks like something out of a Steven Spielberg movie.  The lighting is good and the shadow is falling beautifully onto the book.', '2007-07-10 19:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890452, 549855, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this for a long time. It speaks volumes of a great many things, of which I find difficult to put into words. She stares at me with such wisdom and kindness in her eyes, and it''s hard to look away. Thank you for sharing this. It truly is, for me, a most memorable photograph. Even if I can''t explain to you exactly how. Just know it''s utterly beautiful in every way.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this for a long time. It speaks volumes of a great many things, of which I find difficult to put into words. She stares at me with such wisdom and kindness in her eyes, and it''s hard to look away. Thank you for sharing this. It truly is, for me, a most memorable photograph. Even if I can''t explain to you exactly how. Just know it''s utterly beautiful in every way.', '2007-07-10 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890483, 551403, 80278, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, well executed.</td>', 'Nice concept, well executed.', '2007-07-10 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890486, 551376, 80278, '<td valign="top">Also, oversharpened : super-saturated. A Monarch has its own natural beauty.  In a macro shot like this, the eyes are a must. <br/>Try using an edge mask when you sharpen for a more natural-looking crispness.</td>', 'Also, oversharpened : super-saturated. A Monarch has its own natural beauty.  In a macro shot like this, the eyes are a must. Try using an edge mask when you sharpen for a more natural-looking crispness.', '2007-07-10 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890488, 551401, 80278, '<td valign="top">Bringing some cups forward on the left would create a more interesting angle and enhance the comp.<br/> Great idea though!</td>', 'Bringing some cups forward on the left would create a more interesting angle and enhance the comp. Great idea though!', '2007-07-10 20:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890490, 549757, 80278, '<td valign="top">Clever idea with imagination. Well executed. 9</td>', 'Clever idea with imagination. Well executed. 9', '2007-07-10 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890497, 547569, 80278, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I assume then that the hunted is the viewer?<br/>Seems a bit of a fudge on the challenge title, but as a newbie here, what do I know?</td>', 'Nice title. I assume then that the hunted is the viewer?Seems a bit of a fudge on the challenge title, but as a newbie here, what do I know?', '2007-07-10 20:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890498, 551037, 80278, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but a stretch for the challenge topic.</td>', 'Nice image, but a stretch for the challenge topic.', '2007-07-10 20:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890501, 548485, 80278, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and DOF. the lemon could be crisper though, to add to the bite.<br/>And, a great idea well execulted with thought and careful editing.</td>', 'Nice angle and DOF. the lemon could be crisper though, to add to the bite.And, a great idea well execulted with thought and careful editing.', '2007-07-10 20:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890510, 549644, 80278, '<td valign="top">OOH! Wonderful capture of a Tiger Swallowtail! Can''t ID the plant though. After seeing many boring pics of this lep, this one is truly refreshing! A 10 in my book, but I might be alone here. 10</td>', 'OOH! Wonderful capture of a Tiger Swallowtail! Can''t ID the plant though. After seeing many boring pics of this lep, this one is truly refreshing! A 10 in my book, but I might be alone here. 10', '2007-07-10 20:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890524, 551284, 80278, '<td valign="top">Someone should stop me here:<br/>"Roger, please, I don''t care about your deformity."<br/>"Brenda, once this shoot is over, why don''t we..."<br/>"Still can''t tell if they''re real with this stupid glove on, but who cares?!"</td>', 'Someone should stop me here:"Roger, please, I don''t care about your deformity.""Brenda, once this shoot is over, why don''t we...""Still can''t tell if they''re real with this stupid glove on, but who cares?!"', '2007-07-10 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890528, 550470, 80278, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but where is the dichotomy?</td>', 'Nice image, but where is the dichotomy?', '2007-07-10 20:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890534, 550979, 80278, '<td valign="top">Blatant political statements are always tough. Wonderful idea, and thought provoking.</td>', 'Blatant political statements are always tough. Wonderful idea, and thought provoking.', '2007-07-10 20:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890558, 551180, 80278, '<td valign="top">Ooh goody! A ten at last! <br/>Wonderful idea. Perfect shadows. Wit, as executed by the volumes written about this and other such pointless debates. Wonderful movement. Flawless editing. 10 This should win something. I will send the boys with bats around to anyone who gives this a 3 or lower!</td>', 'Ooh goody! A ten at last! Wonderful idea. Perfect shadows. Wit, as executed by the volumes written about this and other such pointless debates. Wonderful movement. Flawless editing. 10 This should win something. I will send the boys with bats around to anyone who gives this a 3 or lower!', '2007-07-10 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890574, 551355, 80278, '<td valign="top">Oh, all right, I will be the only one to give you a 10. It''s only because I own the original vinyl, and as a piano teacher, teach a few of the tunes on the album, and in fact, just started a HS student on "April in Paris." <br/>Seriously, beyond that, a nice idea, well executed, expecially with the highlights. Don''t be dismayed if you get some 4''s and 5''s. Sleep soundly (pun there) knowing that this was appreciated by at least one viewer. Will add to my faves. 10</td>', 'Oh, all right, I will be the only one to give you a 10. It''s only because I own the original vinyl, and as a piano teacher, teach a few of the tunes on the album, and in fact, just started a HS student on "April in Paris." Seriously, beyond that, a nice idea, well executed, expecially with the highlights. Don''t be dismayed if you get some 4''s and 5''s. Sleep soundly (pun there) knowing that this was appreciated by at least one viewer. Will add to my faves. 10', '2007-07-10 20:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3890584, 551387, 80278, '<td valign="top">Wait, I recognize my wife''s lipstick, and that''s our phone number!<br/>8</td>', 'Wait, I recognize my wife''s lipstick, and that''s our phone number!8', '2007-07-10 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891001, 551196, 64929, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are sooooooo appealing!  Beautiful setting too! *10*</td>', 'The colors in this shot are sooooooo appealing!  Beautiful setting too! *10*', '2007-07-10 23:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891009, 551184, 64929, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and take on the challenge *7*</td>', 'Nice lighting and take on the challenge *7*', '2007-07-10 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891016, 551237, 64929, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the take on the challenge....the only thing that bothers me is the background/drop cloth or whatever it is...makes it look too "studio" *7*</td>', 'I like the shot and the take on the challenge....the only thing that bothers me is the background/drop cloth or whatever it is...makes it look too "studio" *7*', '2007-07-10 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891093, 549884, 81141, '<td valign="top">i love this, its a little sad thou they look a little cut off from nature, but thats the point right!</td>', 'i love this, its a little sad thou they look a little cut off from nature, but thats the point right!', '2007-07-10 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891233, 551179, 76676, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2007-07-11 00:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891290, 547567, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  The highlighting you did ruined the photo in my opinion.  It would have scored higher without the highlighting.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  The highlighting you did ruined the photo in my opinion.  It would have scored higher without the highlighting.  Nice photo though.', '2007-07-11 00:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891300, 549644, 45672, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is something else.  Great colors and sharp focus where it counts.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow, this one is something else.  Great colors and sharp focus where it counts.  Nicely done.', '2007-07-11 00:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891314, 550382, 45672, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!  Nicely done.  I wish the background wasn''t black.  I think a nice gray would have been perfect.</td>', 'What a great idea!  Nicely done.  I wish the background wasn''t black.  I think a nice gray would have been perfect.', '2007-07-11 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891323, 551157, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the subjects.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great contrast between the subjects.  Very nice.', '2007-07-11 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891324, 551364, 70514, '<td valign="top">A bit sad to see such beautiful flowers somewhere so lonely.  Nicely done.  I like the processing and composition.</td>', 'A bit sad to see such beautiful flowers somewhere so lonely.  Nicely done.  I like the processing and composition.', '2007-07-11 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891333, 550997, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love how clear the reflections are.  Lovely contrasting colors, great composition and dof.</td>', 'I love how clear the reflections are.  Lovely contrasting colors, great composition and dof.', '2007-07-11 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891340, 549005, 45672, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one fits the challenge perfectly.  Nice capture.  This one is one of the best in the challenge.  You should do well.</td>', 'Wow, this one fits the challenge perfectly.  Nice capture.  This one is one of the best in the challenge.  You should do well.', '2007-07-11 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891350, 548125, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''ve wondered the same thing.  Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'I''ve wondered the same thing.  Nice composition and lighting.', '2007-07-11 00:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891360, 551329, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great color and expression of the runner.  And yes, running must be done with music!</td>', 'Great color and expression of the runner.  And yes, running must be done with music!', '2007-07-11 00:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891365, 550562, 70514, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious!  Very nice composition and lighting... now if I could just have a slice!</td>', 'Looks delicious!  Very nice composition and lighting... now if I could just have a slice!', '2007-07-11 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891369, 551207, 70514, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image!</td>', 'A wonderful image!', '2007-07-11 00:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891371, 550622, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m in awe that you caught this! Great job, nice composition and detail.</td>', 'I''m in awe that you caught this! Great job, nice composition and detail.', '2007-07-11 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891758, 551060, 80278, '<td valign="top">The image does not show a dichotomy.</td>', 'The image does not show a dichotomy.', '2007-07-11 02:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891763, 550382, 47316, '<td valign="top">this is really neat!</td>', 'this is really neat!', '2007-07-11 02:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891778, 551266, 80278, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there is a lot of noise on the top, at least on my monitor.</td>', 'Good idea, but there is a lot of noise on the top, at least on my monitor.', '2007-07-11 02:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891786, 551311, 80278, '<td valign="top">...and it won''t be the Yankees this year, either.</td>', '...and it won''t be the Yankees this year, either.', '2007-07-11 02:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891917, 551196, 31637, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, the left side should be cropped to remove the branches.</td>', 'This is beautiful, the left side should be cropped to remove the branches.', '2007-07-11 03:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892709, 547823, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is one of those abstract images that is too beautiful not to get a high score.  Obviously the subject was taken at a Clay Aiken concert during an intermission but I don''t think everyone will know that ;P</td>', 'This is one of those abstract images that is too beautiful not to get a high score.  Obviously the subject was taken at a Clay Aiken concert during an intermission but I don''t think everyone will know that ;P', '2007-07-11 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892714, 550886, 38032, '<td valign="top">great presentation</td>', 'great presentation', '2007-07-11 09:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3893394, 548063, 76430, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing picture and visual display of a dichotomy.  I can''t figure out how this was done with a single shot unless the woman actually was made up like that with her left side glammed out and the right side as undone as possible.  I see a ribbon on this one.</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing picture and visual display of a dichotomy.  I can''t figure out how this was done with a single shot unless the woman actually was made up like that with her left side glammed out and the right side as undone as possible.  I see a ribbon on this one.', '2007-07-11 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894272, 551383, 80821, '<td valign="top">Great idea, perfect execution, love the multicoloured flames. Top 5.</td>', 'Great idea, perfect execution, love the multicoloured flames. Top 5.', '2007-07-11 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894567, 551026, 78196, '<td valign="top">A bold idea which works very well. I might have gone for a different flower - a white one would symbolise peace a little better, but I don''t suppose you had much choice. I very much like the contrast between the hands as well as what they''re holding.</td>', 'A bold idea which works very well. I might have gone for a different flower - a white one would symbolise peace a little better, but I don''t suppose you had much choice. I very much like the contrast between the hands as well as what they''re holding.', '2007-07-11 17:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894609, 550710, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nicely converted but the lighting is not ideal - if the duck''s face had been brought out more it would have made a big difference I think. The lighting conditions were obviously very harsh and I think you have done well out of that situation. Unfortunately whilst contrast is shown, the concept of dichotomy is unexplored and the score will suffer as a result.</td>', 'Nicely converted but the lighting is not ideal - if the duck''s face had been brought out more it would have made a big difference I think. The lighting conditions were obviously very harsh and I think you have done well out of that situation. Unfortunately whilst contrast is shown, the concept of dichotomy is unexplored and the score will suffer as a result.', '2007-07-11 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894628, 550867, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here very much. However you have a big problem with noise artifacts, probably as a result of a less than ideal jpeg conversion, or even just a sub-standard camera. I don''t think this addresses the idea of dichotomy as much it could.</td>', 'I like the composition here very much. However you have a big problem with noise artifacts, probably as a result of a less than ideal jpeg conversion, or even just a sub-standard camera. I don''t think this addresses the idea of dichotomy as much it could.', '2007-07-11 17:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894643, 551124, 78196, '<td valign="top">Opposite ends of the spectrum - black and white. Very simple and relevant. Don''t know why I didn''t think of that myself! I don''t think everyone will like the fact that the face is cropped but I think it''s fine. If anything I wonder if the DOF is a bit to shallow? His/her right eye is in focus but I don''t think the left is. But you obviously did the right thing to go for the eyes. Altogether a lovely shot.</td>', 'Opposite ends of the spectrum - black and white. Very simple and relevant. Don''t know why I didn''t think of that myself! I don''t think everyone will like the fact that the face is cropped but I think it''s fine. If anything I wonder if the DOF is a bit to shallow? His/her right eye is in focus but I don''t think the left is. But you obviously did the right thing to go for the eyes. Altogether a lovely shot.', '2007-07-11 17:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894653, 551256, 80886, '<td valign="top">Genius</td>', 'Genius', '2007-07-11 17:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894666, 550909, 78196, '<td valign="top">Thoroughly original. Without the man in the shot the photo wouldn''t amount to much but his dejected pose adds a palpable air of sadness - the extraordinary contradiction that lies between the sad demise of a store and the wildly bold and excited sale posters that advertise it are caught with potency as a result. 8</td>', 'Thoroughly original. Without the man in the shot the photo wouldn''t amount to much but his dejected pose adds a palpable air of sadness - the extraordinary contradiction that lies between the sad demise of a store and the wildly bold and excited sale posters that advertise it are caught with potency as a result. 8', '2007-07-11 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894695, 547569, 78196, '<td valign="top">It''s always great to have shots like this where you feel the creature making eye contact with you. Composition-wise, having the subject off-centre is a great choice, but your background doesn''t do you any favours - it is too close for you to play with DOF so we''re just left with some out-of-focus brown rocks which for me are a bit of a distraction; not that you had any power over this. Looks like we have a bit a purple fringing in vital areas which is a pity. But none of this detracts from the fact that you clearly have the eye for a very striking shot.</td>', 'It''s always great to have shots like this where you feel the creature making eye contact with you. Composition-wise, having the subject off-centre is a great choice, but your background doesn''t do you any favours - it is too close for you to play with DOF so we''re just left with some out-of-focus brown rocks which for me are a bit of a distraction; not that you had any power over this. Looks like we have a bit a purple fringing in vital areas which is a pity. But none of this detracts from the fact that you clearly have the eye for a very striking shot.', '2007-07-11 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894704, 549643, 78196, '<td valign="top">You''re right - the one on the left looks stupidly angelic, and there is definitely something a bit Hannibal Lecter about the other. Unfortunately, and I''m sure you don''t need me to tell you this, the quality of the image is too low and the colours too washed out for this shot to do well.</td>', 'You''re right - the one on the left looks stupidly angelic, and there is definitely something a bit Hannibal Lecter about the other. Unfortunately, and I''m sure you don''t need me to tell you this, the quality of the image is too low and the colours too washed out for this shot to do well.', '2007-07-11 17:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894715, 551288, 78196, '<td valign="top">A good concept imaginatively shot. Seriously over-sharpened however! The colours are washed out as a result of your camera (a trip though PS or equivalent could make a difference but not enough of one) and I think that a greater focus on their expressions in a simpler setting might have proved more effective.</td>', 'A good concept imaginatively shot. Seriously over-sharpened however! The colours are washed out as a result of your camera (a trip though PS or equivalent could make a difference but not enough of one) and I think that a greater focus on their expressions in a simpler setting might have proved more effective.', '2007-07-11 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894725, 551256, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Had me in stitches - and that was before I saw the title! I can only say how highly jealous I am of your wit and creativity.</td>', 'Wonderful. Had me in stitches - and that was before I saw the title! I can only say how highly jealous I am of your wit and creativity.', '2007-07-11 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894743, 551410, 78196, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract well-shot. The contrast between red and blue is evident and well emphasised by the refractions in the glass. I don''t feel this is enough to represent the challenge however.</td>', 'An interesting abstract well-shot. The contrast between red and blue is evident and well emphasised by the refractions in the glass. I don''t feel this is enough to represent the challenge however.', '2007-07-11 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894772, 549537, 78196, '<td valign="top">Your choice of colours is bold and unusual, however I can''t pretend I understand your intentions and how the concept represents dichotomy.</td>', 'Your choice of colours is bold and unusual, however I can''t pretend I understand your intentions and how the concept represents dichotomy.', '2007-07-11 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894784, 550647, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure whether you''ve selectively blurred or just used an incredibly shallow depth of field, either way I do find the blur a little too much though it undoubtedly brings the leaf to the fore and emphasises its outline. A nice and simple use of selective desat and a powerful concept well illustrated.</td>', 'I''m not sure whether you''ve selectively blurred or just used an incredibly shallow depth of field, either way I do find the blur a little too much though it undoubtedly brings the leaf to the fore and emphasises its outline. A nice and simple use of selective desat and a powerful concept well illustrated.', '2007-07-11 17:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894809, 551302, 78196, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit of a stretch for dichotomy, but I like the concept all the same! I assume this shot is an originally non-humourous photo gone wrong? Either way the bride and groom do not look sufficiently involved in murdering/being murdered! It''s a pity about the white shirts, as a darker colour would have worked better against such a light background.</td>', 'I think this is a bit of a stretch for dichotomy, but I like the concept all the same! I assume this shot is an originally non-humourous photo gone wrong? Either way the bride and groom do not look sufficiently involved in murdering/being murdered! It''s a pity about the white shirts, as a darker colour would have worked better against such a light background.', '2007-07-11 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894820, 551355, 78196, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice concept and the composition is good too. What we lack is sharpness and definition - here we''d really like to see every groove in the record - I think the camera is at fault here rather than the photographer :)</td>', 'Quite a nice concept and the composition is good too. What we lack is sharpness and definition - here we''d really like to see every groove in the record - I think the camera is at fault here rather than the photographer :)', '2007-07-11 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894838, 551405, 78196, '<td valign="top">An absolutely super concept capturing wonderful expressions and employing a really fantastic use of black and white. The weakness in the shot is the jpeg - there is a fair amount of noise and, more seriously, jaggies (the coat is the prime example with that contrast). I''d think about using another program to save your jpegs. But I''m voting high for the great concept and well-executed shot.</td>', 'An absolutely super concept capturing wonderful expressions and employing a really fantastic use of black and white. The weakness in the shot is the jpeg - there is a fair amount of noise and, more seriously, jaggies (the coat is the prime example with that contrast). I''d think about using another program to save your jpegs. But I''m voting high for the great concept and well-executed shot.', '2007-07-11 17:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894851, 551330, 78196, '<td valign="top">The composition is great. The concept is not ideal for dichotomy but works at a stretch - the big problem here is image quality (sky gradation provides the starkest example - put the darkness up on your monitor and look at those jaggies!!). This is the fault of the camera not the photographer, though I wonder what you are using to resize and save your jpegs?</td>', 'The composition is great. The concept is not ideal for dichotomy but works at a stretch - the big problem here is image quality (sky gradation provides the starkest example - put the darkness up on your monitor and look at those jaggies!!). This is the fault of the camera not the photographer, though I wonder what you are using to resize and save your jpegs?', '2007-07-11 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894857, 551216, 78196, '<td valign="top">The concept is a little beyond me but from a technical perspective the dirt and sweat is very well done, and well lit too.</td>', 'The concept is a little beyond me but from a technical perspective the dirt and sweat is very well done, and well lit too.', '2007-07-11 17:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894861, 550860, 78196, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea! Like the composition too.</td>', 'Really nice idea! Like the composition too.', '2007-07-11 17:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894888, 551289, 78196, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept. What interests me about churches is their domination over the town skyline - perhaps circumstances don''t allow it but I wonder whether you could have been more imaginative with the composition?</td>', 'An interesting concept. What interests me about churches is their domination over the town skyline - perhaps circumstances don''t allow it but I wonder whether you could have been more imaginative with the composition?', '2007-07-11 18:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894905, 551025, 78196, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a beautiful shot. In terms of the challenge the term dichotomy is not a concrete one and it''s difficult to say whether or not a photo really meets the concept or not - here however I would suggest it''s underexplored. The sunflower in the background is crystal clear - with the one in the foreground I think you either need to make the aperture tiny to bring it in focus or to make the fact it''s out of focus a feature. Here it''s stuck in between and it''s not quite satisfying. But those colours... Wonderful.</td>', 'Technically this is a beautiful shot. In terms of the challenge the term dichotomy is not a concrete one and it''s difficult to say whether or not a photo really meets the concept or not - here however I would suggest it''s underexplored. The sunflower in the background is crystal clear - with the one in the foreground I think you either need to make the aperture tiny to bring it in focus or to make the fact it''s out of focus a feature. Here it''s stuck in between and it''s not quite satisfying. But those colours... Wonderful.', '2007-07-11 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894907, 550626, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Orinigal idea, well lit, great use of DOF.</td>', 'Excellent. Orinigal idea, well lit, great use of DOF.', '2007-07-11 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895078, 551405, 80311, '<td valign="top">A colored ballon would of complement better the photo... but very nice idea!</td>', 'A colored ballon would of complement better the photo... but very nice idea!', '2007-07-11 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895089, 551120, 80311, '<td valign="top">Nice research for this one!</td>', 'Nice research for this one!', '2007-07-11 18:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895101, 548760, 80311, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the concept!</td>', 'Nice use of the concept!', '2007-07-11 18:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895106, 551341, 72579, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2007-07-11 18:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895107, 551311, 80311, '<td valign="top">That was sure a nice show to watch!</td>', 'That was sure a nice show to watch!', '2007-07-11 18:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895110, 551256, 80311, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2007-07-11 18:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895127, 551296, 80311, '<td valign="top">Cool! nice contrast!</td>', 'Cool! nice contrast!', '2007-07-11 18:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895493, 551157, 2337, '<td valign="top">Your likely to have quite a few folks that don''t understand this aspect of the word Dichotomy.  Well shot, but the light is a bit harsh in the upper right.  Wonderful choice of the wood grain to go with the leaf.</td>', 'Your likely to have quite a few folks that don''t understand this aspect of the word Dichotomy.  Well shot, but the light is a bit harsh in the upper right.  Wonderful choice of the wood grain to go with the leaf.', '2007-07-11 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895515, 550382, 2337, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Grats</td>', 'Stunning.  Grats', '2007-07-11 19:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3895523, 551410, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Interesting tones and shape. More like a painting than a photo.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Interesting tones and shape. More like a painting than a photo.', '2007-07-11 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
