(3897752, 551201, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great lighting in this and its so true isn''t it. Our children can take us to the limits in so many opposing ways.</td>', 'Great lighting in this and its so true isn''t it. Our children can take us to the limits in so many opposing ways.', '2007-07-12 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
