(3898299, 551332, 70000, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the wolverine fur really takes over the photograph, im looking at the hair wondering where it came from and why it is there instead of looking at the arrowheads, a simpler background would have been more approriate in my opnion</td>', 'I like the concept but the wolverine fur really takes over the photograph, im looking at the hair wondering where it came from and why it is there instead of looking at the arrowheads, a simpler background would have been more approriate in my opnion', '2007-07-12 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
