(3898307, 551348, 70000, '<td valign="top">haha cute idea, i think the background and composition really take away from the impact of the dichotomy between ice and fire, maybe if you had a black background and held the match between 2 fingers so that on one side the fire shoots up and on the other you have the ice and get a drop dripping off the ice, the composition would be much more interesting</td>', 'haha cute idea, i think the background and composition really take away from the impact of the dichotomy between ice and fire, maybe if you had a black background and held the match between 2 fingers so that on one side the fire shoots up and on the other you have the ice and get a drop dripping off the ice, the composition would be much more interesting', '2007-07-12 17:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3898309, 550033, 70000, '<td valign="top">haha she has awesome hair, the wild takes over the photograph though, more light on her eyes (highlights in her eyes are really dull) would balance it out more</td>', 'haha she has awesome hair, the wild takes over the photograph though, more light on her eyes (highlights in her eyes are really dull) would balance it out more', '2007-07-12 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
