(3898457, 551296, 78062, '<td valign="top">Great stitching of the photos, however a few things bug me:<br/> <br/>The sharpness could be better and the left face looks a little bland, maybe some selctive dodge/burn there?<br/> <br/>Also, the halos around the edges get to me. This could have been shot with the kit lens, i''m not sure, but they''re definately visible in the downsized version here and distract from an otherwise great picture.</td>', 'Great stitching of the photos, however a few things bug me: The sharpness could be better and the left face looks a little bland, maybe some selctive dodge/burn there? Also, the halos around the edges get to me. This could have been shot with the kit lens, i''m not sure, but they''re definately visible in the downsized version here and distract from an otherwise great picture.', '2007-07-12 18:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
