(3901736, 551383, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh that is very cool!! I love the processing to the flames. I know many probably won''t but I do. And I see how it meets the challenge too. Great job.</td>', 'Oh that is very cool!! I love the processing to the flames. I know many probably won''t but I do. And I see how it meets the challenge too. Great job.', '2007-07-13 21:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901745, 551321, 66398, '<td valign="top">Color and b/w I suppose are mutually exclusive ideas so... meets the challenge. As for technicals I think you did a great job with the line between the two. My only nitpick would be in the b/w area I''d like to see a little more clarity on the horse but it isn''t bad the way it is either.</td>', 'Color and b/w I suppose are mutually exclusive ideas so... meets the challenge. As for technicals I think you did a great job with the line between the two. My only nitpick would be in the b/w area I''d like to see a little more clarity on the horse but it isn''t bad the way it is either.', '2007-07-13 21:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
