(3902828, 551405, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s a hard choice, isn''t it?  Like the use of the black balloon.</td>', 'That''s a hard choice, isn''t it?  Like the use of the black balloon.', '2007-07-14 12:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903071, 551179, 62187, '<td valign="top">People are funny. Who would ask for validation for your photo? It''s gotta be obvious - the ''shadow'' is a paper cut-out laying on the floor I''m almost sure of it. SUPER job! You''ve got my vote and it''s a 10.</td>', 'People are funny. Who would ask for validation for your photo? It''s gotta be obvious - the ''shadow'' is a paper cut-out laying on the floor I''m almost sure of it. SUPER job! You''ve got my vote and it''s a 10.', '2007-07-14 14:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903105, 551029, 62187, '<td valign="top">''...drew their swords and shot each other...'' I was thinking of that old poem just the other day. Imagine that! Bizarre photo - I got your back. I mean front. I mean, oh what the heck: 10!</td>', '''...drew their swords and shot each other...'' I was thinking of that old poem just the other day. Imagine that! Bizarre photo - I got your back. I mean front. I mean, oh what the heck: 10!', '2007-07-14 14:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
