(3903886, 551388, 73747, '<td valign="top">Good image. I like the composition and color. The buildings are just a tad harsh and that big cloud in the upper left somehow distracts me. "Is that smog or smoke" seems to keep going through my head. Otherwise very nice! *7*</td>', 'Good image. I like the composition and color. The buildings are just a tad harsh and that big cloud in the upper left somehow distracts me. "Is that smog or smoke" seems to keep going through my head. Otherwise very nice! *7*', '2007-07-14 22:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
