(3903913, 548063, 73747, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  It really whiplashed my eyes going back and forth between the two sides.  My mind was denying that the left side could be the same person as the right, but my eyes were telling me it was. How much of what our eyes see is just... made up!?!? So much "reality" gets covered up and hidden! We never see it! A photo that can reveal that the way this one does is worth a 10! Good job!</td>', 'Very clever!  It really whiplashed my eyes going back and forth between the two sides.  My mind was denying that the left side could be the same person as the right, but my eyes were telling me it was. How much of what our eyes see is just... made up!?!? So much "reality" gets covered up and hidden! We never see it! A photo that can reveal that the way this one does is worth a 10! Good job!', '2007-07-14 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903919, 551060, 77196, '<td valign="top">So, either you''re not human, or you don''t use the land? Someone has got to do a tutorial on how to capture moving water like that without blowing out the highlights. Nice shot.</td>', 'So, either you''re not human, or you don''t use the land? Someone has got to do a tutorial on how to capture moving water like that without blowing out the highlights. Nice shot.', '2007-07-14 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903928, 550647, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not if you get caught! Nice photo - like the lighting on the hand vs. on the leaf.</td>', 'Not if you get caught! Nice photo - like the lighting on the hand vs. on the leaf.', '2007-07-14 22:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903961, 549643, 73747, '<td valign="top">Rather fuzzy and lacking in sharpness.</td>', 'Rather fuzzy and lacking in sharpness.', '2007-07-14 22:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903974, 549855, 77196, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I had a hard time figuring out the hands / arms. The models are not looking / faced the same direction. The girl is not looking at the older lady whom she is hugging. Nor is the girl facing the camera. If the child  and adult were looking at each other, or both looking directly at camera, I think it would draw you more into the picture and the moment. Nice focus &amp; lighting.</td>', 'For some reason, I had a hard time figuring out the hands / arms. The models are not looking / faced the same direction. The girl is not looking at the older lady whom she is hugging. Nor is the girl facing the camera. If the child  and adult were looking at each other, or both looking directly at camera, I think it would draw you more into the picture and the moment. Nice focus & lighting.', '2007-07-14 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903978, 548760, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think the layers of different background colors with distinct borders detracts significantly from this photo. This is a typical result of editing, but I find it distracting to any degree, but it is especially strong in your shot.</td>', 'I think the layers of different background colors with distinct borders detracts significantly from this photo. This is a typical result of editing, but I find it distracting to any degree, but it is especially strong in your shot.', '2007-07-14 23:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903993, 551161, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah, but the game isn''t over yet - with responsible use Mother Nature can make a comeback (and maybe even without it, though I''m not sure it is wise to take that risk) - look at the forests in the North East, the rivers in Ohio &amp; New York. <br/> <br/>Maybe it is intentional, but the picture looks a bit washed out.</td>', 'Ah, but the game isn''t over yet - with responsible use Mother Nature can make a comeback (and maybe even without it, though I''m not sure it is wise to take that risk) - look at the forests in the North East, the rivers in Ohio & New York.  Maybe it is intentional, but the picture looks a bit washed out.', '2007-07-14 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904030, 550129, 2158, '<td valign="top">Wow, it looks like the moon has been cut in half and it''s hollow inside.  I''ve never seen a shot like that before.</td>', 'Wow, it looks like the moon has been cut in half and it''s hollow inside.  I''ve never seen a shot like that before.', '2007-07-14 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904284, 549969, 67237, '<td valign="top">I understand the complexity of a shot like this (which it does fit the challenge), but would like to see a less shallow dof, specially in the upper white areas. Besides, for an insects iliterate like myself it is hard to figure out which specific parts depict the hunter and the prey..Bearing all that in mind this is a 6 for me.</td>', 'I understand the complexity of a shot like this (which it does fit the challenge), but would like to see a less shallow dof, specially in the upper white areas. Besides, for an insects iliterate like myself it is hard to figure out which specific parts depict the hunter and the prey..Bearing all that in mind this is a 6 for me.', '2007-07-15 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904287, 551130, 67237, '<td valign="top">too much noise and saturation here</td>', 'too much noise and saturation here', '2007-07-15 01:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
