(3904868, 550470, 66398, '<td valign="top">What a great shot of some very cute kids. Not seeing how it meets the challenge though so comment only - no vote.</td>', 'What a great shot of some very cute kids. Not seeing how it meets the challenge though so comment only - no vote.', '2007-07-15 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
