(3904871, 551215, 66398, '<td valign="top">You might want to back down a little on the red channel. Not so much because of the sky but the horse is now also red as well as the highlights in the grass. Also I don''t see how this fits the challenge so comment only - no vote.</td>', 'You might want to back down a little on the red channel. Not so much because of the sky but the horse is now also red as well as the highlights in the grass. Also I don''t see how this fits the challenge so comment only - no vote.', '2007-07-15 11:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904883, 549969, 66398, '<td valign="top">What is that? A white moth? I know this probably wasn''t an easy shot to get and not subjects willing to cooperate with poses but a different color in the bg would have set this off a little better. It is advanced editing though so possibly a hue adjustment on in layers on the bg would have done it. The spider needs to be a little sharper imo but not a bad shot at all. Difficult to catch nature in action like this without making the spider go away. Good catch (no pun intended).</td>', 'What is that? A white moth? I know this probably wasn''t an easy shot to get and not subjects willing to cooperate with poses but a different color in the bg would have set this off a little better. It is advanced editing though so possibly a hue adjustment on in layers on the bg would have done it. The spider needs to be a little sharper imo but not a bad shot at all. Difficult to catch nature in action like this without making the spider go away. Good catch (no pun intended).', '2007-07-15 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904887, 550129, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity. Dark and light sides of the moon well represented.</td>', 'Nice clarity. Dark and light sides of the moon well represented.', '2007-07-15 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904891, 551330, 66398, '<td valign="top">Did you do a hue adjustment on the sky? There is a line at the horizon that doesn''t seem to be either sky or water. Maybe your adjustment layer for the sky included some of the water which made a different colored line from both.</td>', 'Did you do a hue adjustment on the sky? There is a line at the horizon that doesn''t seem to be either sky or water. Maybe your adjustment layer for the sky included some of the water which made a different colored line from both.', '2007-07-15 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904909, 548063, 66398, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your title is helping this amazing shot. Maybe something like before and after makover would have worked? Although I''m sure she put on make up, did her hair and put on the earring on one side only I can still tell that some of her beauty on the made up side is from editing because of the lack of red lines in her eye on the made up side. If you had left in just a hint more of them I wouldn''t have known for sure. Great job overall on this really though. Just my little nitpicks. 8</td>', 'I don''t think your title is helping this amazing shot. Maybe something like before and after makover would have worked? Although I''m sure she put on make up, did her hair and put on the earring on one side only I can still tell that some of her beauty on the made up side is from editing because of the lack of red lines in her eye on the made up side. If you had left in just a hint more of them I wouldn''t have known for sure. Great job overall on this really though. Just my little nitpicks. 8', '2007-07-15 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904911, 551364, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great detail work on the selective desat. It works for the shot too.</td>', 'Great detail work on the selective desat. It works for the shot too.', '2007-07-15 11:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904912, 550013, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and symetry in this. Great eye and view of the challenge.</td>', 'Love the colors and symetry in this. Great eye and view of the challenge.', '2007-07-15 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904915, 551329, 66398, '<td valign="top">Ahhh I remember those days. I really need to get back into it. I wish I just had the motivation to get started again.</td>', 'Ahhh I remember those days. I really need to get back into it. I wish I just had the motivation to get started again.', '2007-07-15 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904923, 550979, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve depicted more than just one faith in this. I also think the desaturation level leaving just a hint of color works quite well to affect the mood of it. A little more clarity on the gun would have helped as well as maybe adjusting the highlights and shadow or brightness and contrast in a layer with just the gun would have brought it out just a little better. After the challenge is over if you''d like for me to show you what I mean then just PM me. Excellent idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you''ve depicted more than just one faith in this. I also think the desaturation level leaving just a hint of color works quite well to affect the mood of it. A little more clarity on the gun would have helped as well as maybe adjusting the highlights and shadow or brightness and contrast in a layer with just the gun would have brought it out just a little better. After the challenge is over if you''d like for me to show you what I mean then just PM me. Excellent idea for the challenge.', '2007-07-15 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904926, 551216, 66398, '<td valign="top">That''s actually a very scary shot these days. I really like the shot but I''m not sure I get how it fits the challenge so comment only - no vote.</td>', 'That''s actually a very scary shot these days. I really like the shot but I''m not sure I get how it fits the challenge so comment only - no vote.', '2007-07-15 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904936, 551388, 66398, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your title is helping you here. I love the way you''ve captured the stormy dark clouds on the left with the bright chearful fluffy clouds on the right. Maybe a title that played on that would help viewers see that dichotomy a little better. Maybe "from stormy night to sunny day"? Or something else close to that. GREAT capture by the way. With no title at all I can see dichotomy in this shot. I can''t say that for a many entries in this. 9</td>', 'I don''t think your title is helping you here. I love the way you''ve captured the stormy dark clouds on the left with the bright chearful fluffy clouds on the right. Maybe a title that played on that would help viewers see that dichotomy a little better. Maybe "from stormy night to sunny day"? Or something else close to that. GREAT capture by the way. With no title at all I can see dichotomy in this shot. I can''t say that for a many entries in this. 9', '2007-07-15 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904946, 550980, 66398, '<td valign="top">If you created and placed those signs then I think I would have made the "somewhere" sign say "skidrow" but hey that''s just me. I think you''ve done a great job with the challenge. I like the balance in color. With all the color on the guy headed to somewhere the lack of color on the guy headed to wallstreet is balanced out by the spot of color in the field on the right. The composition is done well here also. My only real nitpick is that it apears to be just a bit oversharpened in the path and the grass.</td>', 'If you created and placed those signs then I think I would have made the "somewhere" sign say "skidrow" but hey that''s just me. I think you''ve done a great job with the challenge. I like the balance in color. With all the color on the guy headed to somewhere the lack of color on the guy headed to wallstreet is balanced out by the spot of color in the field on the right. The composition is done well here also. My only real nitpick is that it apears to be just a bit oversharpened in the path and the grass.', '2007-07-15 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904950, 550086, 66398, '<td valign="top">Dominoes are such fun.</td>', 'Dominoes are such fun.', '2007-07-15 12:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904954, 549537, 66398, '<td valign="top">Really not fond of the processing on this and I''m sure you''re already taking a beating so that''s all I''ll say on that. As far as the challenge I think you''ve met it but I wouldn''t have gotten that without the title so I think your title was a great choice.</td>', 'Really not fond of the processing on this and I''m sure you''re already taking a beating so that''s all I''ll say on that. As far as the challenge I think you''ve met it but I wouldn''t have gotten that without the title so I think your title was a great choice.', '2007-07-15 12:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904959, 550334, 66398, '<td valign="top">The scene here is so busy. I like the idea though and think desire and ability are definately dichotomous.</td>', 'The scene here is so busy. I like the idea though and think desire and ability are definately dichotomous.', '2007-07-15 12:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3904966, 550870, 66398, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the center composition works as well for this shot as a thirds composition would have. Not that every shot needs use the thirds rule just that this particular one would have worked better with it imo. Though it isn''t what your title leads me to believe, I''m going to consider the dichotomy as color / black and white because I think that''s a stronger theme in this.</td>', 'I don''t think the center composition works as well for this shot as a thirds composition would have. Not that every shot needs use the thirds rule just that this particular one would have worked better with it imo. Though it isn''t what your title leads me to believe, I''m going to consider the dichotomy as color / black and white because I think that''s a stronger theme in this.', '2007-07-15 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905022, 547567, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve already gotten plenty of comments about the apparent editing around the boats and far shoreline.  You would have been much better off simply  bumping the contrast and leaving them as silhouettes rather than this.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve already gotten plenty of comments about the apparent editing around the boats and far shoreline.  You would have been much better off simply  bumping the contrast and leaving them as silhouettes rather than this.', '2007-07-15 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
