(3905162, 548485, 61824, '<td valign="top">More of a contrast than a dichotomy.  I like the like the composition, the frozen motion. and the other-worldly quality.  7</td>', 'More of a contrast than a dichotomy.  I like the like the composition, the frozen motion. and the other-worldly quality.  7', '2007-07-15 14:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905168, 549350, 61824, '<td valign="top">If this was done with costume and makeup effects alone, as it appears, it is a stunning achievement.  If it was done with photo editing alone, it is still a stunning achievement because it looks so much like it was done with costume and makeup effects alone.  I think the blank background takes away from the impact.  8</td>', 'If this was done with costume and makeup effects alone, as it appears, it is a stunning achievement.  If it was done with photo editing alone, it is still a stunning achievement because it looks so much like it was done with costume and makeup effects alone.  I think the blank background takes away from the impact.  8', '2007-07-15 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905171, 549643, 61824, '<td valign="top">More of a contrast than a dichotomy.  I don''t think the depicted emotions and attitudes come through in the photo.  I like the composition and the color pallette.  6</td>', 'More of a contrast than a dichotomy.  I don''t think the depicted emotions and attitudes come through in the photo.  I like the composition and the color pallette.  6', '2007-07-15 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905175, 550519, 33672, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the theme so far. Nice tones and concept. Comp is extraordinary. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the theme so far. Nice tones and concept. Comp is extraordinary. 10', '2007-07-15 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905177, 551332, 61824, '<td valign="top">There is something disconcerting about the fur template - it seems almost pornographic.  This might say more about my psychology than your photograph, but it might be helpful to show the edges of the pelt so it is clearer what we are looking at.  I think I would have had the arrowheads pointing at each other to play up the idea of dichotomy.  Most interesting choice of subject.  7</td>', 'There is something disconcerting about the fur template - it seems almost pornographic.  This might say more about my psychology than your photograph, but it might be helpful to show the edges of the pelt so it is clearer what we are looking at.  I think I would have had the arrowheads pointing at each other to play up the idea of dichotomy.  Most interesting choice of subject.  7', '2007-07-15 14:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905180, 551348, 61824, '<td valign="top">How cool!  I would have tried a gradient background tone rather than a flat black - something is needed to accentuate the water drop.  Very creative interpretation.  9</td>', 'How cool!  I would have tried a gradient background tone rather than a flat black - something is needed to accentuate the water drop.  Very creative interpretation.  9', '2007-07-15 14:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905181, 550886, 61824, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color vs. black and white.  Maybe the older shoes could have been in rougher shape - "scarred by life" as it were.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'Nice use of color vs. black and white.  Maybe the older shoes could have been in rougher shape - "scarred by life" as it were.  Nicely done. 8', '2007-07-15 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905184, 551184, 61824, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious.  I like the use of background and shadow to enhance the contrast.  Interesting composition.  8</td>', 'Very mysterious.  I like the use of background and shadow to enhance the contrast.  Interesting composition.  8', '2007-07-15 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905187, 551215, 61824, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see a dichotomy here - maybe a contrast.  Interesting combination of elements. 5</td>', 'Not sure I see a dichotomy here - maybe a contrast.  Interesting combination of elements. 5', '2007-07-15 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905189, 551374, 61824, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a dichotomy here - its a contrast.  For a dichotomy, the elements should work against each other in some way.  Nice colors and contrast.  5</td>', 'I don''t see a dichotomy here - its a contrast.  For a dichotomy, the elements should work against each other in some way.  Nice colors and contrast.  5', '2007-07-15 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905221, 551364, 61824, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation and composition.  I might have gone for deeper depth of field.  8</td>', 'Interesting interpretation and composition.  I might have gone for deeper depth of field.  8', '2007-07-15 15:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905226, 551306, 61824, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a dichomtomy - I don''t see the conflict.  The composition and subjects are interesting.  The unpleasant color cast does not add to the photo''s impact.  5</td>', 'I don''t think this is a dichomtomy - I don''t see the conflict.  The composition and subjects are interesting.  The unpleasant color cast does not add to the photo''s impact.  5', '2007-07-15 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905231, 547569, 61824, '<td valign="top">I think I get that the cat, while a hunter, is also hunted by man (or perhaps by you, the photographer!) but I don''t think that comes through in the photo.  The composition and color pallette are interesting and appropriate.  7</td>', 'I think I get that the cat, while a hunter, is also hunted by man (or perhaps by you, the photographer!) but I don''t think that comes through in the photo.  The composition and color pallette are interesting and appropriate.  7', '2007-07-15 15:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905234, 550647, 61824, '<td valign="top">I think I get that nature and man are often in conflict (by man''s choice) but I don''t think that comes through in the photo - I don''t see the conflict illustrated.  I like the composition and the use of monochrome vs. color.</td>', 'I think I get that nature and man are often in conflict (by man''s choice) but I don''t think that comes through in the photo - I don''t see the conflict illustrated.  I like the composition and the use of monochrome vs. color.', '2007-07-15 15:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905236, 551398, 61824, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject and interpretation of the challenge, but I don''t think a dichotomy is illustrated here.  There is also a strange outliney kind of effect around the animals that doesn''t quite work. 6</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject and interpretation of the challenge, but I don''t think a dichotomy is illustrated here.  There is also a strange outliney kind of effect around the animals that doesn''t quite work. 6', '2007-07-15 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905242, 551026, 61824, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  A nitpicky comment - I would have used a prettier flower.  Interesting that the hand wielding the gun is a female''s.  9</td>', 'Nicely done.  A nitpicky comment - I would have used a prettier flower.  Interesting that the hand wielding the gun is a female''s.  9', '2007-07-15 15:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905249, 551132, 61824, '<td valign="top">Stong choice of subject - interesting that they are intertwined in this shot.  Another shot in the challenge shows a gun pointed at a flower, and I think that more effectively gets to the idea of dichotomy (are both shots the work of the same artist, I wonder?).  The flower is a little blown out and the gun is a little too shadowy.  7</td>', 'Stong choice of subject - interesting that they are intertwined in this shot.  Another shot in the challenge shows a gun pointed at a flower, and I think that more effectively gets to the idea of dichotomy (are both shots the work of the same artist, I wonder?).  The flower is a little blown out and the gun is a little too shadowy.  7', '2007-07-15 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905258, 550402, 61824, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this shows dichotomy - just opposites.  He is a cute fellow, though.  I wonder if it happened in a fight?  Nice framing and color pallette. 7</td>', 'I don''t think this shows dichotomy - just opposites.  He is a cute fellow, though.  I wonder if it happened in a fight?  Nice framing and color pallette. 7', '2007-07-15 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905262, 549538, 61824, '<td valign="top">I like Escher, but I''m not sure this is a dichotomy so much as a pair of oppostites.  The spilled liquid doesn''t look quite right - looks like one of those gag novelty plastic things.  I like the composition and I think the blank background works.  7</td>', 'I like Escher, but I''m not sure this is a dichotomy so much as a pair of oppostites.  The spilled liquid doesn''t look quite right - looks like one of those gag novelty plastic things.  I like the composition and I think the blank background works.  7', '2007-07-15 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905268, 550873, 61824, '<td valign="top">I can get with the dual nature of amphibious life as a dichotomy, but I think it would have been better to have shown the contrast/conflict somehow in the photograph - perhaps one water-guy frog and one land-guy frog.  The composition and color pallette are nice, and the shallow depth of field works.  7</td>', 'I can get with the dual nature of amphibious life as a dichotomy, but I think it would have been better to have shown the contrast/conflict somehow in the photograph - perhaps one water-guy frog and one land-guy frog.  The composition and color pallette are nice, and the shallow depth of field works.  7', '2007-07-15 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905272, 550911, 61824, '<td valign="top">This one rates high on the wow meter - stunning effect, making the model both beautiful and sinister at the same time.  9</td>', 'This one rates high on the wow meter - stunning effect, making the model both beautiful and sinister at the same time.  9', '2007-07-15 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905286, 549644, 61824, '<td valign="top">This is a contrast, not a dichotomy - the two elements are not in conflict or mutually exclusive - in fact, quite the opposite.  I like the composition and color contrast.  Macro photography always impresses me because I am totally incapable of doing it.  7</td>', 'This is a contrast, not a dichotomy - the two elements are not in conflict or mutually exclusive - in fact, quite the opposite.  I like the composition and color contrast.  Macro photography always impresses me because I am totally incapable of doing it.  7', '2007-07-15 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905287, 550874, 61824, '<td valign="top">Not a dichotomy, just a contrast - a neat one, though.  Nice use of rule of thirds, and the blank background works.  I really like this photo, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.  My sense the aesthetics wins out over jurisprudence - 7.</td>', 'Not a dichotomy, just a contrast - a neat one, though.  Nice use of rule of thirds, and the blank background works.  I really like this photo, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.  My sense the aesthetics wins out over jurisprudence - 7.', '2007-07-15 15:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905289, 550382, 61824, '<td valign="top">Most interesting illustration of the ultimate dichotomy!  The monochrome works, as does the contrast between the costumes and skin color of the models.  Might have worked better with an African American model, or by putting the dark makeup on the models arms as well (would have ruined the dress, though...)  Excellent work.  9</td>', 'Most interesting illustration of the ultimate dichotomy!  The monochrome works, as does the contrast between the costumes and skin color of the models.  Might have worked better with an African American model, or by putting the dark makeup on the models arms as well (would have ruined the dress, though...)  Excellent work.  9', '2007-07-15 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905290, 550960, 61824, '<td valign="top">Well done - rich natural colors contrast with the cold whites, blues, and greys of the plastics.  Might have worked better in a portrait orientation (maybe the plastic field wasn''t wide enough?).  Excellent work 9</td>', 'Well done - rich natural colors contrast with the cold whites, blues, and greys of the plastics.  Might have worked better in a portrait orientation (maybe the plastic field wasn''t wide enough?).  Excellent work 9', '2007-07-15 15:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
