(3905632, 550383, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ha - funny catch.  Nice colors.</td>', 'Ha - funny catch.  Nice colors.', '2007-07-15 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905635, 549757, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the comparison - great alignment.  Beautiful gradient in the sky.  I wish the bright light spot were not showing in the pic.</td>', 'I like the comparison - great alignment.  Beautiful gradient in the sky.  I wish the bright light spot were not showing in the pic.', '2007-07-15 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905636, 550346, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  Love the silhouette.</td>', 'Great catch.  Love the silhouette.', '2007-07-15 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905640, 551180, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think the book did - hehe<br/> <br/>Great idea.  Love the lighting.</td>', 'I think the book did - hehe Great idea.  Love the lighting.', '2007-07-15 18:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905642, 550997, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is good - love the play with words.  Beautiful reflections.</td>', 'This is good - love the play with words.  Beautiful reflections.', '2007-07-15 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905646, 551256, 67697, '<td valign="top">Really nice job of getting the yolk out and not breaking it!  Symbolism arranged well here.</td>', 'Really nice job of getting the yolk out and not breaking it!  Symbolism arranged well here.', '2007-07-15 18:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905653, 550334, 67697, '<td valign="top">Without the title I may not have totally gotten this.  This is a great catch tho and does give you something to think about.</td>', 'Without the title I may not have totally gotten this.  This is a great catch tho and does give you something to think about.', '2007-07-15 18:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905662, 549554, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a photo that certainly makes you want to know more about what is going on.</td>', 'This is a photo that certainly makes you want to know more about what is going on.', '2007-07-15 18:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905733, 551289, 67697, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the church roof is kind of stuck in the middle of everything like this.</td>', 'Interesting that the church roof is kind of stuck in the middle of everything like this.', '2007-07-15 19:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905740, 550960, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The sky is a beautiful blue.  Love the mountains in the background.</td>', 'Great composition.  The sky is a beautiful blue.  Love the mountains in the background.', '2007-07-15 19:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905743, 550402, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love that he seems to be posing for you.  Great color tones.  Great clarity and nice detail of the fur.</td>', 'Love that he seems to be posing for you.  Great color tones.  Great clarity and nice detail of the fur.', '2007-07-15 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905750, 551179, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very Mary Poppins like.  Cute.  This should do pretty well.</td>', 'Very Mary Poppins like.  Cute.  This should do pretty well.', '2007-07-15 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905754, 551376, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great macro - love the sharpness.  It''s seems as tho the butterfly is posing for the pic.</td>', 'Great macro - love the sharpness.  It''s seems as tho the butterfly is posing for the pic.', '2007-07-15 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905756, 549350, 41337, '<td valign="top">So well done Cindi!</td>', 'So well done Cindi!', '2007-07-15 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905801, 550960, 52169, '<td valign="top">Love this image. What is it?</td>', 'Love this image. What is it?', '2007-07-15 20:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905803, 549005, 52169, '<td valign="top">I really love this one. Has a real sci-fi feel to it. 8</td>', 'I really love this one. Has a real sci-fi feel to it. 8', '2007-07-15 20:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905806, 551401, 52169, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2007-07-15 20:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905808, 549757, 52169, '<td valign="top">awesome! 10</td>', 'awesome! 10', '2007-07-15 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905809, 551387, 52169, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2007-07-15 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905854, 551405, 6999, '<td valign="top">The parallele deep blackness of the child''s balloon and the ball and chain perhaps make a connection you didn''t intend: at least, I can''t imagine a slightly soft focus image here genuinely meaning to attest to some form of post-natal depression, or making some comment on motherhood''s restrictions on career. There''s something, in the nolder woman''s look, that is also quite threatening; all in all, quite a sinister image, really.</td>', 'The parallele deep blackness of the child''s balloon and the ball and chain perhaps make a connection you didn''t intend: at least, I can''t imagine a slightly soft focus image here genuinely meaning to attest to some form of post-natal depression, or making some comment on motherhood''s restrictions on career. There''s something, in the nolder woman''s look, that is also quite threatening; all in all, quite a sinister image, really.', '2007-07-15 20:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905914, 551401, 61824, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge indeed.  I''m not sure the shallow depth of field works.  Nice use of rule of thirds.  8</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge indeed.  I''m not sure the shallow depth of field works.  Nice use of rule of thirds.  8', '2007-07-15 21:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905926, 551116, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  Love the slight color in the background.  The purple flower on the right really pops out.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  Love the slight color in the background.  The purple flower on the right really pops out.', '2007-07-15 21:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905929, 551306, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great find.  That''s a pretty cool looking mural.</td>', 'Great find.  That''s a pretty cool looking mural.', '2007-07-15 21:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905930, 551120, 61824, '<td valign="top">High marks for an interesting take on the challenge.  The photo itself is rather busy, the snail doesn''t stand out enough, and I don''t think the black background works. Gutsy choice of subject.  6.</td>', 'High marks for an interesting take on the challenge.  The photo itself is rather busy, the snail doesn''t stand out enough, and I don''t think the black background works. Gutsy choice of subject.  6.', '2007-07-15 21:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905932, 548289, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is great - love the drooping one in the background and how it contrasts with the one in front.</td>', 'This is great - love the drooping one in the background and how it contrasts with the one in front.', '2007-07-15 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905933, 548760, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  I like the black and white contrasts.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  I like the black and white contrasts.', '2007-07-15 21:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905934, 551180, 61824, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is really a dichotomy so much as a paradox, but its a very interesting idea, and well executed.  I love the use of rule of thirds and the frozen motion.  It''s a little dark for my taste.  7</td>', 'Not sure if this is really a dichotomy so much as a paradox, but its a very interesting idea, and well executed.  I love the use of rule of thirds and the frozen motion.  It''s a little dark for my taste.  7', '2007-07-15 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905939, 551016, 61824, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that ancient vs. modern is really a dichotomy so much as a contrast.  There are some very interesting objects pictured, but too many, I think.  I like the idea of using the old map as a backdrop.  6.</td>', 'I don''t know that ancient vs. modern is really a dichotomy so much as a contrast.  There are some very interesting objects pictured, but too many, I think.  I like the idea of using the old map as a backdrop.  6.', '2007-07-15 21:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905941, 547831, 61824, '<td valign="top">She is gorgeous.  I don''t see enough of the tomboy to make it really work for me as far as the challenge is concerned - maybe if she were in a treehouse or something.  Lighting and composition are very pleasing.  7.</td>', 'She is gorgeous.  I don''t see enough of the tomboy to make it really work for me as far as the challenge is concerned - maybe if she were in a treehouse or something.  Lighting and composition are very pleasing.  7.', '2007-07-15 21:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905947, 550129, 61824, '<td valign="top">If the dichotomy is light vs. dark then I follow you.  It''s a great shot, but it doesn''t holler "dichotomy" at me.  6.</td>', 'If the dichotomy is light vs. dark then I follow you.  It''s a great shot, but it doesn''t holler "dichotomy" at me.  6.', '2007-07-15 21:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905951, 549895, 61824, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  The water itself and its role in the overall composition isn''t clear enough to make it work for me.  6.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  The water itself and its role in the overall composition isn''t clear enough to make it work for me.  6.', '2007-07-15 21:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905961, 551296, 61824, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of hard work went into this one.  I like the idea of using monochrome vs. color to accetuate the conflict.  I also like the use of symmetry (an object in each hand, glasses of different styles on each side).  Very nice job - hope you do well!  9</td>', 'Looks like a lot of hard work went into this one.  I like the idea of using monochrome vs. color to accetuate the conflict.  I also like the use of symmetry (an object in each hand, glasses of different styles on each side).  Very nice job - hope you do well!  9', '2007-07-15 21:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905978, 550253, 61824, '<td valign="top">Very cool and kind of spooky.  Certainly the subjects pictured are very different, but it looks like they are working together rather than mutually excluding each other.  I will really look forward to the photographer''s comments on this one.  Are you illustrating the dichotomy of nature that is within us all?  It''s so cool that I''ll put aside my confusion over adherance to the challenge theme - 8.</td>', 'Very cool and kind of spooky.  Certainly the subjects pictured are very different, but it looks like they are working together rather than mutually excluding each other.  I will really look forward to the photographer''s comments on this one.  Are you illustrating the dichotomy of nature that is within us all?  It''s so cool that I''ll put aside my confusion over adherance to the challenge theme - 8.', '2007-07-15 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905979, 550860, 61824, '<td valign="top">Two very different media, to be sure, but hardly mutually exclusive - there can be cheese without chalk and chalk without cheese, and Chalk-E-Cheese if you try hard enough.  The photo itself is very busy and the title subjects are de-emphasized.  I give you kudos for trying something different.  5</td>', 'Two very different media, to be sure, but hardly mutually exclusive - there can be cheese without chalk and chalk without cheese, and Chalk-E-Cheese if you try hard enough.  The photo itself is very busy and the title subjects are de-emphasized.  I give you kudos for trying something different.  5', '2007-07-15 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905987, 547795, 61824, '<td valign="top">The Bible or the Bottle?  Interesting take on the challenge.  Although you draw attention to the book by making it red, and to the inscription by putting it close to the ice cubes, I think you should have brought it out a little more - perhaps a large Bible would have worked better.  Very creatively done - 8.</td>', 'The Bible or the Bottle?  Interesting take on the challenge.  Although you draw attention to the book by making it red, and to the inscription by putting it close to the ice cubes, I think you should have brought it out a little more - perhaps a large Bible would have worked better.  Very creatively done - 8.', '2007-07-15 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3905990, 551311, 61824, '<td valign="top">I can relate - my brother is a long-suffering north-sider.  Great take on the challenge.  I really like the subjects being positioned with their backs to each other, but turned forward enough so we can see their accountrements.  Well thought upon and well executed - I hope you do well.  9.</td>', 'I can relate - my brother is a long-suffering north-sider.  Great take on the challenge.  I really like the subjects being positioned with their backs to each other, but turned forward enough so we can see their accountrements.  Well thought upon and well executed - I hope you do well.  9.', '2007-07-15 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3906062, 550470, 74979, '<td valign="top">don''t get the dichotomy nor the title, but I love the image!</td>', 'don''t get the dichotomy nor the title, but I love the image!', '2007-07-15 22:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
