(3907209, 551201, 53572, '<td valign="top">wonderful image todd.  simple, elegant, and highly charged.  i love the darkness, the ambiguity, the faint threat in the perfectly innocent gesture.  the textures, the quality of the cotton dress.  all simply perfect.  thank you.</td>', 'wonderful image todd.  simple, elegant, and highly charged.  i love the darkness, the ambiguity, the faint threat in the perfectly innocent gesture.  the textures, the quality of the cotton dress.  all simply perfect.  thank you.', '2007-07-16 07:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3907210, 551256, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad this shot was yours... you always take the time to give the explanations and stories behind your creative shots, and they''re usually just as interesting as the shots themselves.  It''s great to read your progression from an idea, through the ''how-to'', with the adjustments you needed to make to get that final shot.  For instance, while I was voting, I was so impressed with how you could have possibly gotten the yolk and egg separated so neatly, I never made the connection to the lighting which completed the edge of the shape.  Great job, and congrats on yet another ribbon!  So, how many eggs did you actually go through? :)</td>', 'I''m so glad this shot was yours... you always take the time to give the explanations and stories behind your creative shots, and they''re usually just as interesting as the shots themselves.  It''s great to read your progression from an idea, through the ''how-to'', with the adjustments you needed to make to get that final shot.  For instance, while I was voting, I was so impressed with how you could have possibly gotten the yolk and egg separated so neatly, I never made the connection to the lighting which completed the edge of the shape.  Great job, and congrats on yet another ribbon!  So, how many eggs did you actually go through? :)', '2007-07-16 07:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
