(3908472, 551405, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is such a creative image.  The connection between the balloon and the black ball on the chain is what really impresses me.  I gave it a 9 instead of a 10 because of a couple of minor technical issues, namely the jaggies on the edge of the woman''s jacket (possibly due to resizing?) and the slight tilt/distortion of the scene.  Still, I think it should have been in the top ten.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is such a creative image.  The connection between the balloon and the black ball on the chain is what really impresses me.  I gave it a 9 instead of a 10 because of a couple of minor technical issues, namely the jaggies on the edge of the woman''s jacket (possibly due to resizing?) and the slight tilt/distortion of the scene.  Still, I think it should have been in the top ten.  Very well done.', '2007-07-16 16:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
