(3909384, 550033, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yeah, watch out for Mabel. Them redheads are crazy unpredictable!</td>', 'Yeah, watch out for Mabel. Them redheads are crazy unpredictable!', '2007-07-16 23:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3909413, 550867, 50695, '<td valign="top">Eliza, your interpretation is a sound one, but not the only one. I saw all the holes as thought, established by having his head look like one of the holes. "Action" is implied by his profession, and the unmade environment that he is there to build up. The rubble below him is chaos, and the lines can be taken to represent some sort of organizing process, like a flowchart.<br/> <br/>But the reason this gets a ribbon is that beyond the intellectual interpretation there is a strong *feeling* and *mood*. I interpret it as a Hamlet sort of quandary, which is supported by your title. Others will interpret it differently. But the feeling is there, and strong.</td>', 'Eliza, your interpretation is a sound one, but not the only one. I saw all the holes as thought, established by having his head look like one of the holes. "Action" is implied by his profession, and the unmade environment that he is there to build up. The rubble below him is chaos, and the lines can be taken to represent some sort of organizing process, like a flowchart. But the reason this gets a ribbon is that beyond the intellectual interpretation there is a strong *feeling* and *mood*. I interpret it as a Hamlet sort of quandary, which is supported by your title. Others will interpret it differently. But the feeling is there, and strong.', '2007-07-16 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3909419, 550891, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dichotomy is the obvious one: inside and outside. But the *title* puts a sardonic twist on it, by designating the inside as a non-smoking area and the outside as a smoking area... <br/> <br/>...oh wait, there''s an ashtray on the table...<br/> <br/>ok, ignore the title! :D</td>', 'the dichotomy is the obvious one: inside and outside. But the *title* puts a sardonic twist on it, by designating the inside as a non-smoking area and the outside as a smoking area...  ...oh wait, there''s an ashtray on the table... ok, ignore the title! :D', '2007-07-16 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 0),
