(4815723, 551296, 30807, '<td valign="top">This is one shot, taken in colour, converted on the left to B+W by the sound of the glasses thing. Is this you, or did you take this, or both? If it''s one shot, an unusual shirt, or one over each shoulder<br/> <br/>Quite inventive - you like a challenge, obviously.<br/> <br/>I would maybe have done this in two shots, kept the shades and glasses whole, and just superimposed one over the other - but that may not be such a challenge<br/> <br/>It has given me an idea though for a shot of me<br/> <br/>Thanks<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-09 19:07:38.</i></td>', 'This is one shot, taken in colour, converted on the left to B+W by the sound of the glasses thing. Is this you, or did you take this, or both? If it''s one shot, an unusual shirt, or one over each shoulder Quite inventive - you like a challenge, obviously. I would maybe have done this in two shots, kept the shades and glasses whole, and just superimposed one over the other - but that may not be such a challenge It has given me an idea though for a shot of me Thanks', '2008-07-09 20:03:20.000000', '2008-07-09 20:07:38.000000', 0),
